  {
    "row": 129,
    "type": "NOTE:TNAM",
    "editor": "VMS52LineholmReport",
    "en": "This holotape contains an list of NCR personnel on active duty at Ranger Station Alpha. Aside from one Ranger who suffered a fractured ankle during a fall, the station has been at full strength for months."
  },
  {
