  {
    "row": 131,
    "type": "NOTE:TNAM",
    "editor": "VMS52PasonReport",
    "en": "This holotape contains a list a patrol reports dating back the last few months. Aside from an incident where an NCR patrol was wiped out by one of its own grenades - the result of trooper negligence - the reports are otherwise unremarkable."
  },
